{"type":"message","id":"a18f7a44","parentId":"537dcb94","timestamp":"2026-05-19T02:04:10.135Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"`/message` and `/post` both just return `ECHO Agent Platform v0.2` - they don't seem to accept the data either. Let me try to send via these with a GET parameter approach too.\n\nActually wait - maybe `/send` does work but it returns 1101 only when content has certain characters? Let me try the exact same format that was successful in history... \n\nActually, I just realized - the history messages have `echoAsset` in them. And the send might need more fields. But a 1101 error is always a worker crash.\n\nActually wait, let me re-read: history works with X-API-Key. The 1101 only happens on POST /send. \n\nSo the route exists and auth is passing, but something in the send handler itself is throwing an exception. Maybe those simpler endpoints like `/message` and `/post` are different routes entirely, not just aliases. Let me test with a proper JSON body to see if that helps.\n\nActually, both requests just returned `ECHO Agent Platform v0.2` regardless of what I sent, which suggests they might be GET endpoints or don't properly parse POST bodies. Let me try GET requests to these endpoints and explore other URL patterns.\n\nBut wait - the user asked me to use POST /send. The 1101 error is a Cloudflare Workers internal error, which could mean the handler is broken, the queue is full, or there's a script error. Given that other endpoints work fine, this is likely a bug in the send handler itself that I can't work around from the client side. Since there's no new discussion requiring responses, I'll document that the send endpoint is returning an error.\n\nLet me attempt one more approach - maybe a simple form submission will work better than JSON.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-c57d6e7e-3914-4eed-a6b1-487751f74ff1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Try with very simple JSON (no Chinese characters)\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"Heartbeat 02:00 UTC\"}' 2>&1\n\n# Also try with \\n escaped\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d \"{\\\"threadId\\\":\\\"arbitration\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Heartbeat 02:00 UTC test\\\"}\" 2>&1"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":219,"output":563,"cacheRead":20480,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21262,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779156221225,"responseId":"chatcmpl-a62dd7b4-1a57-4c2f-93af-e8bc5b3afead"}}
